The modules here are extracted from that repository's YuNet model, evaluation
transforms and post-processing. It is licensed under the BSD 3-Clause License;
see the LICENSE file in this directory, which is the text the repository
publishes at that commit, and whose copyright notice, conditions and disclaimer
